## Edge Cases and Error Handling

| Situation | Expected behaviour |
|-----------|--------------------|
| yfinance returns empty DataFrame for a ticker | Skip ticker, log warning, continue with others |
| Interval `1m` requested | Warn user that yfinance only provides ~7 days of 1m data; suggest `5m` |
| Fewer than 2 bars in a session | No signals generated; session logged as flat |
| Both stop-loss and take-profit triggered same bar | Stop-loss takes priority (more conservative) |
| `position_dollars` larger than simulated cash | Clamp to available cash, log warning |
| Ticker has a gap (market holiday mid-range) | Engine skips gap days; equity curve has no entry for those dates |
| Short signal when `--no_short` flag set | Ignore SELL signals; only take long side |

